  "description": "Inject raw street art energy, fast marker strokes, and rebellious urban attitude into your graphic layouts with Elaesy! Designed as a high-impact graffiti tag font, it features sharp angles, expressive hand-drawn marker swoops, and authentic street-style flow. Its energetic silhouette gives action sports graphics, hip-hop apparel, and urban posters an unmistakable handcrafted edge.\nIdeal for streetwear apparel, skate deck graphics, hip-hop cover art, graffiti logo designs, sports banners, poster headlines, sticker packs, and custom Cricut or Silhouette craft SVG projects!",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Inject raw street art energy, fast marker strokes, and rebellious urban attitude into your graphic layouts with Elaesy! Designed as a high-impact graffiti tag font, it features sharp angles, expressive hand-drawn marker swoops, and authentic street-style flow. Its energetic silhouette gives action sports graphics, hip-hop apparel, and urban posters an unmistakable handcrafted edge.</p>\n<p>Ideal for streetwear apparel, skate deck graphics, hip-hop cover art, graffiti logo designs, sports banners, poster headlines, sticker packs, and custom Cricut or Silhouette craft SVG projects!</p>",
